tools/validation/hr24_clusters.ecsv

# Benchmark RUN artifacts. The repo commits a JSON sidecar for every script that produces a
# quoted number, but these two exceed the 500 KB pre-commit ceiling (3-10 MB: 108 cells x
# per-star arrays). They were already untracked-but-unignored, which reads as an oversight
# rather than a decision; this makes it a decision. Regenerate with
#   python tools/validation/benchmark_erotica_vs_asteca.py
# The SUMMARY sidecars that carry the quoted numbers ARE committed
# (ptilde_decomposition.json, erroraware_mc_convergence.json).
tools/validation/benchmark_*.json
tools/validation/benchmark_*.cells.jsonl
!tools/validation/benchmark_*_summary.json
